[
    {
        "content": "<p>To whom it may concern. Deleted ~52M log records from the last 6.5 years from our prod. database today. Took ~90min to delete + vacuum. Here are some handy SQL snippets I picked up along the way. Startup time from 10m down to 2m.</p>\n<p>Get list of tables sorted by size</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"SQL\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"k\">SELECT</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">nspname</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">AS</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">schema_name</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">c</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">relname</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">AS</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">table_name</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">pg_size_pretty</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">pg_table_size</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">c</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">oid</span><span class=\"p\">))</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">AS</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">table_size</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">pg_size_pretty</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">pg_indexes_size</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">c</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">oid</span><span class=\"p\">))</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">AS</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">indexes_size</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">pg_size_pretty</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">pg_total_relation_size</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">c</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">oid</span><span class=\"p\">))</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">AS</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">total_size</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">FROM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">pg_class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">c</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">JOIN</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">pg_namespace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">ON</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">oid</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">c</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">relnamespace</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">WHERE</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">c</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">relkind</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">IN</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s1\">'r'</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s1\">'p'</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">-- ordinary tables (and partitioned tables on PG 10+)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">AND</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">nspname</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">NOT</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">IN</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s1\">'pg_catalog'</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s1\">'information_schema'</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">AND</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">nspname</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">NOT</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">LIKE</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s1\">'pg_toast%'</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">ORDER</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">BY</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">pg_total_relation_size</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">c</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">oid</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">DESC</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">-- sort by real bytes, not by the pretty text</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">nspname</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">c</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">relname</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>Copy old logs to CSV, avoid buffering the full result in client memory.</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Bash\"><pre><span></span><code>kubectl<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nb\">exec</span><span class=\"w\"> </span>postgresql-7fb9699986-rwqxc<span class=\"w\"> </span>--<span class=\"w\"> </span>psql<span class=\"w\"> </span>-U<span class=\"w\"> </span>dataverse<span class=\"w\"> </span>dataverse<span class=\"w\"> </span>-c<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"COPY (SELECT * FROM actionlogrecord WHERE starttime &lt; '2026-09-01 00:00:00' ORDER BY starttime) TO STDOUT WITH (FORMAT csv, HEADER);\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span>&gt;<span class=\"w\"> </span>actionlogrecord-20260501-till-20260901.csv\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>Remove old logs and free space</p>\n<p>Note: Vacuum means downtime! When deleting large numbers of rows, this will take more than just a few minutes!</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"SQL\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"k\">DELETE</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">FROM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">actionlogrecord</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">WHERE</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">starttime</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s1\">'2026-09-01 00:00:00'</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">vacuum</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">full</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">actionlogrecord</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
